    "bio": "Ansel Barclay is a photographer, filmmaker, and visual storyteller born and raised in the rugged woods of New Hampshire. His deep roots in the outdoors, forged through years of skiing and mountain biking, fuel his passion projects, transforming high-adrenaline hobbies into a distinct creative canvas. Beyond the wilderness, Ansel brings a sharp eye for fashion to his commercial work, collaborating with apparel brands to elevate their visual identity and expand their market reach. His expertise extends seamlessly from stills to motion. As a versatile director and producer, Ansel captures the raw energy of major musicians at iconic venues and handles production for compelling short films. A graduate of the School of Film and Photography at Montana State University, Ansel is constantly pushing the boundaries of his craft. Keep an eye out for his latest releases..."
